# ==============================================================================
# CITYPULSE SMART CITY INTELLIGENCE PLATFORM — ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. CORE ZERO-KEY SERVICES (ALWAYS FUNCTIONAL WITHOUT ANY API KEY)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The following features operate out-of-the-box using direct open APIs:
# - Open-Meteo High-Resolution Atmospheric & Weather Forecasts (worldwide)
# - Open-Meteo Copernicus CAMS Air Quality Telemetry (PM2.5, PM10, AQI, O3, NO2)
# - OpenStreetMap Nominatim Facility Geocoding (hospitals, schools, police, etc.)
# - OSRM Road Topology & Routing Machine (real road-network routes & duration)
# - National Weather Service (NWS) Active Emergency Bulletins (US coordinates)
# - CartoDB Dark Matter GIS Cartography Tiles

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. SERVER-SIDE CREDENTIALS (RECOMMENDED FOR SECURE DEPLOYMENTS)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Configured in your hosting environment (e.g., Vercel, Node.js server) so visitors
# never need to enter an API key and secrets are never exposed in browser bundles:
#
# - TOMTOM_API_KEY: Enables serverless proxy (/api/traffic) for real-time TomTom
#   vehicle probe incident details and flow delays.
#   Sign up for free key at: https://developer.tomtom.com
TOMTOM_API_KEY=your_server_tomtom_api_key_here

# - GEMINI_API_KEY: Enables serverless proxy (/api/chat) for Google Gemini
#   generative natural language reasoning with grounded city context.
#   Sign up for free key at: https://aistudio.google.com
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_server_gemini_api_key_here

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. CLIENT-SIDE OPTIONAL VARIABLES (FOR LOCAL OVERRIDES OR DIRECT ACCESS)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If set, these are bundled into the frontend client. They are completely optional:
VITE_TOMTOM_API_KEY=
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. SUPABASE (OPTIONAL — FOR USER ACCOUNTS & CROSS-DEVICE SEARCH HISTORY)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If left blank, the platform stores bookmarks and settings locally in browser localStorage.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here
